Hi all,

I think it's time to schedule the release of lm-sensors 3.0.2. There
have been a number of fixes and improvements to pwmconfig and
sensors-detect since 3.0.2 (although not as many as I hoped) so let's
have a new release so that users can benefit.

Proposed schedule:

* September 23rd: SVN freeze
* September 24th to 28th: testing
* September 29th: release

